    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Nestled within a mature, exclusive 10 unit cul-de-sac, 10 Islandganniv Place offers the perfect blend of peaceful detached living and town convenience. Located just 1.5km from the heart of Listowel, this beautiful family home enjoys seamless connectivity via a public footpath, street lighting, and all mains services, with easy access to the N69 relief road. \r\n\r\nInside, the spacious 175 sq.m. layout is flooded with natural light, featuring an inviting entrance hall, two generous reception rooms, a seamless kitchen/dining area that flows into a sun lounge, a utility room, and a downstairs W/C. Upstairs, four well-appointed bedrooms (including one ensuite) and a family bathroom provide ample space for growing families. \r\n\r\nComplete with a tarmacadam driveway and manicured front and rear gardens, this property is a rare find. Viewing is highly advised to fully appreciate the serene setting and quality lifestyle this home has to offer - to arrange a viewing please call Dillon Prendiville Auctioneers 068-21739."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 4.1m x 2.9m \r\nWith semi solid flooring and red deal staircase to first floor level.\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 6.0m x 3.9m \r\nWith semi solid flooring, solid fuel open fireplace with cast-iron insert and marble surround - dual aspect overlooking front and rear garden.\r\n\r\nReception Room - 4.2m x 4.0m \r\nReception room/ground floor bedroom/study with semi solid flooring, two windows overlooking the front driveway and lawn.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Area - 5.0m x 4.0m \r\nTiled flooring, fully fitted solid oak shaker style kitchen with sink, ceramic electric hob, double oven, integrated dishwasher, recessed ceiling lights and window overlooking rear garden.\r\n\r\nSun Lounge - 3.2m x 3.7m \r\nAdjacent to kitchen/dining area, offering additional living dining space with tiled flooring and vaulted ceiling -  three way aspect with French doors to rear garden.\r\n\r\nUtility Room - 2.8m x 4.0m \r\nIncorporating ground floor toilet and wash and basin with tiled flooring and rear door access.  Firebird oil boiler with three heating zones and large fitted hot press - plumbed for washing and drying.\r\n\r\nLanding - 3.3m x 5.6m \r\nFeature landing space with fitted carpet, attic access hatch and window overlooking the front garden and surrounding countryside.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (Master) - 5.6m x 4.0m \r\nMaster bedroom with walk-in wardrobe, fitted carpet and two windows framing views are surrounding countryside.  Incorporating walk-in wardrobe and ensuite - tiled floor to ceiling, shower, wc, whb and frosted window.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.1m x 4.0m \r\nLaminate flooring, built-in wardrobe and dormer window overlooking front garden and surrounding countryside. \n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.5m x 4.0m \r\nFitted carpet, built-in wardrobe and window overlooking rear garden.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom - 2.8m x 2.4m \r\nWith tiled flooring, complete with bath, wc, whb, shower and frosted window\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 3.9m x 3.0m \r\nWith laminate flooring, built-in wardrobe and window overlooking rear garden.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Built 2005 with all mains services.\r\nDouble glazed PVC windows and doors.\r\nOil fired central heating - three heating zones.\r\nBlock built boundary walls with natural hedgerow to rear. \r\nAdjacent to designated green area.\r\nAttractive countryside aspect.\r\nTarmac driveway and vehicle rear access available \r\nVery private setting \r\nMature lawns."
      },
      {
